/verification_and_validation/*.csv

# Per-machine performance reports (perf_report). GPU/CPU timings differ per
# machine, so the benchmark generates a fresh report on each user's hardware
# here; only the committed methodology template is versioned, never one box's
# numbers. See src/perf_report.rs and examples/gpu_wmp_bench.rs.
/verification_and_validation/local_perf/
